1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,875
Some quick reactions first.

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:08,658
Over zinc chloride at three hundred degrees, ammonia replaces the O H to give aniline.

3
00:00:08,658 --> 00:00:13,684
Distilling phenol with zinc dust removes the oxygen, giving benzene.

4
00:00:13,684 --> 00:00:19,205
And sodium metal, or sodium hydroxide, gives sodium phenoxide.

